{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"EVIDENCE OF COMPLETION — merged.\n\nChange: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2146 (LLM-Review+1, Verified+1, submitted; merged as 051e920b3b on main).\n\nWhat landed: AcliClient.invalidate_search_cache(jql=None) — the supported freshness door (per-JQL evict; full clear on None; never-searched evict is a no-op). _search_cache initialization moved into __init__ (search_issues drops its lazy hasattr branch — complexity ratchet reported the function as an allowed improvement). Client lifetime (one reconcile pass per instance, citing bind_operation_runtime and select_backend) documented at the cache definition; negative-caching hazard documented in the search_issues docstring. Both reach-in sites migrated onto the door via callable-guarded lookup: access_check.py JQL retry loop and _fresh_search in tests/integration/test_reconcile_live_e2e.py.\n\nACs:\n- AC1 (lifetime answered + documented at cache definition): DONE — __init__ comment cites bind_operation_runtime (reconcile_helpers.py:675) and select_backend (_backend_registry.py:60-76).\n- AC2 (door exists; no reach-in outside acli.py): DONE — grep -rn _search_cache src tests shows only acli.py + docstring mentions; pytest tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_acli_search_cache_freshness.py: 4 passed (memoized negative, evict makes negative-to-positive flip visible, full clear, no-op edge — all counted at the _run seam).\n- AC3 (negative-caching documented): DONE — search_issues docstring names the hazard and the door (bug d30c).\n- AC4 (binding_recovery audit): DONE — proof recorded in the prior AUDIT comment on this ticket.\n\nGates: targeted 81 passed (freshness + sweep + timeout + access-check seam + preflight); make lint (complexity ratchet new=0 increased=0); make typecheck clean; CI Verified+1. Rate-limit sweep classifies invalidate_search_cache NON-MUTATING (pure memo evict)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787470591011679001,"uuid":"f71771bf-550a-44be-b023-839ee02732c8"}